{
  "name": "Workflow C - Quote Approval and Send",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow C — Approval & Send\n\nTriggered by a rep opening the Form link from the Slack notification (sent by Tool - Request Quote Draft). deal_id, contact_id, and package_name arrive as hidden fields prefilled from the link's query parameters — VERIFY this hidden-field-from-query-param behavior in your live n8n editor before trusting it (Rule 3); this is a newer Form node capability worth confirming against your version.\n\nSends a plain email, not a native HubSpot Quote — deliberate simplification per the project decision (native Quotes need a Products library + Quote template not yet configured in HubSpot). Upgrade path later: only the 'Send Quote Email' node would need replacing, nothing else in this workflow.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500
      },
      "name": "Sticky - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1024,
        -64
      ],
      "id": "a0b4a324-9750-4a0d-9290-270474d25270"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Quote Approval",
        "formDescription": "Review the quote request and approve or reject.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldName": "deal_id",
              "fieldType": "hiddenField"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "contact_id",
              "fieldType": "hiddenField"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "package_name",
              "fieldType": "hiddenField"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "channel",
              "fieldType": "hiddenField"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Decision",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Approve"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Reject"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Final Price",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Additional Notes to Customer",
              "fieldType": "textarea"
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "hiddenField"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "path": "quote-approval"
        }
      },
